{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03201","headline":"和酬虢州李司法 · 杨炯","name":"和酬虢州李司法","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唇齿标形胜，关河壮邑居。\n寒山抵方伯，秋水面鸿胪。\n君子从游宦，忘情任卷舒。\n风霜下刀笔，轩盖拥门闾。\n平野芸黄遍，长洲鸿雁初。\n菊花宜泛酒，浦叶好裁书。\n昔我芝兰契，悠然云雨疎。\n非君重千里，谁有惠双鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}